<title>UK: Lloyd's sets Aviation business unit.</title>
<headline>Lloyd's sets Aviation business unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lloyd's of London insurance market said on Tuesday it will operate Lloyd's Aviation as a separate business unit to provide loss adjusting and other services to the Lloyd's market and other insurers worldwide.</p>
<p>&quot;The business unit structure is already proving beneficial in terms of awareness of customers' requirements, reducing costs and further improving service standards,&quot; said Lloyd's chief executive Ron Sandler.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
